6
00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:38.000
and turn the incident into owned
prevention work.

7
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.824
Detect impact and declare deliberately.
Signals can begin with failed

8
00:00:43.824 --> 00:00:49.647
quality or safety checks, unsupported
output, authorization denials, unusual

9
00:00:49.647 --> 00:00:55.471
resource use, queue growth, latency, cost,
