10
00:00:55.471 --> 00:01:01.294
loss, a bad deployment, or a user report.
Correlate the

11
00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:07.118
request, exact serving build, policy
decision, infrastructure, dependency

12
00:01:07.118 --> 00:01:12.941
state, and observed outcome before calling
every symptom a model

13
00:01:12.941 --> 00:01:18.765
failure. Set severity from actual and
credible potential impact to

14
00:01:18.765 --> 00:01:24.588
people, data, authorization, external
actions, service, money, and legal or

15
00:01:24.588 --> 00:01:30.412
safety duties. A fluent answer can conceal
unauthorized access, while

16
00:01:30.412 --> 00:01:36.235
a visible timeout may have no lasting
effect or may

17
00:01:36.235 --> 00:01:42.059
