116
00:13:13.667 --> 00:13:20.000
prevention backlog with owners and dates.

117
00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:26.250
Begin the check when you can set severity
from impact,

118
00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:32.500
select narrow containment, reconcile a
timeout, preserve governed evidence,

119
00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:38.750
validate more than endpoint health, and
define evidence-based closure. The

120
00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:45.000
